HumanDoc:
  docs/skills/cross-cutting/observability/metrics.md

Evidence:
  - Prometheus Documentation
  - RED Method
  - Production experience

Rules:
  [M1] Use RED metrics (Rate, Errors, Duration).
  [M2] Use histograms for latency distributions.
  [M3] Use labels for dimensions (service, endpoint, status).
  [M4] Set up alerts for error rate spikes.
  [M5] Create dashboards for key services.
  [M6] Monitor SLOs with error budget.
  [M7] Use exemplars for trace correlation.
  [M8] Avoid high cardinality labels.

Pros:
  - Quick insights
  - Alerting
  - Capacity planning

Cons:
  - Alert fatigue
  - Storage cost
  - Noise

Alternatives:
  - Logs only
  - Tracing only
  - APM tools

State: +

